{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"ce191540-7629-4c28-bff8-9c15fe0d0f1e","status":"SUCCESS","response":"**Fixed the Intervals.icu OAuth integration.**  \nAll changes are documented in the generated artifact:\n\n[ANSWER.md](/Users/valentinakoniukhova/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/ce191540-7629-4c28-bff8-9c15fe0d0f1e/ANSWER.md)  \n\nKey updates applied:\n\n- Made the init endpoint a **POST** that returns `authorize_url` as JSON.  \n- Updated the SPA to use a **Connect** button that calls this POST endpoint, receives the URL, and redirects.  \n- Simplified the token exchange to only send `client_id`, `client_secret`, and `code`.  \n- Fixed duplicate scopes in `config.py`.  \n- Adjusted server routing to handle the new POST init flow.  \n\nThese changes resolve the non‑working **Connect** button and prevent the “Duplicate scope” error. Follow the verification steps in the answer file to confirm the fix.\n","duration_seconds":129.631881,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":31505,"output_tokens":12359,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":387584,"total_tokens":43864}}}
